{#
  "Ihr Abo ruht" (Abo-5, P37), to the customer, in the language of the order:
  an invoice of the subscription is past its payment term and grace period,
  so the access rests until the payment arrives. Factual, no threat and no
  reminder count — dunning is not the core's (A6).

  Loaded as @Contao/mail/consho_subscription_suspended.html.twig. Parameters
  are a LIST (vsprintf, see consho_payment_received.html.twig).

  Variables:
    order         the overdue order in InvoiceView's shape, in the order's language
    customer      {name, email}
    subscription  the subscription number, "SHOP-00084-1"
    invoice       the open invoice's number, attached; '' where none stands
    dueDate       its payment term, formatted
    outstanding   what is still open, formatted
    viewUrl       the order page, with a token
#}
{% block subject %}{{ 'CONSHO.mail.subscriptionSuspended.subject'|trans([subscription], 'contao_default') }}{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
{% set font = 'font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #222222;' %}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #f4f4f4;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding: 24px 12px;">
{% include '@Contao/mail/_frame_head.html.twig' %}
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background: #ffffff; {{ font }}">
<tr><td style="padding: 24px 28px;">

<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.salutation'|trans([customer.name], 'contao_default') }}</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.subscriptionSuspended.intro'|trans([invoice ?: order.orderNumber, subscription, dueDate, outstanding], 'contao_default') }}</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.subscriptionSuspended.resume'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}</p>

{% include '@Contao/mail/_order_context.html.twig' with {order: order, font: font} only %}

{% if invoice %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.subscriptionInvoice.invoiceAttached'|trans([invoice], 'contao_default') }}</p>
{% endif %}

<p style="margin: 24px 0 0 0;">
    <a href="{{ viewUrl }}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #222222; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 3px;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.viewOrder'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}</a>
</p>

</td></tr>
</table>
{% include '@Contao/mail/_frame_foot.html.twig' %}
</td></tr>
</table>
{% endblock %}
